<slide>
  <style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(248,250,252)"/></fill></style>
  <data>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="0" topLeftY="0" width="960" height="70"><fill><fillColor color="linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(30,58,138,1) 0%,rgba(59,130,246,1) 100%)"/></fill></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="50" topLeftY="15" width="800" height="40"><content textType="headline" fontSize="24" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" bold="true"><p>05 自主扩展一：相关文章推荐</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="50" topLeftY="95" width="420" height="120" presetHandlers="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(239,246,255,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(147,197,253,1)" width="1"/></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="70" topLeftY="108" width="380" height="25"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="15" color="rgba(30,58,138,1)" bold="true"><p>功能设计</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="70" topLeftY="140" width="380" height="65"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(51,65,85,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6"><p>在文章详情页底部展示与当前文章主题相关的推荐文章，提升用户阅读深度和站内停留时间。基于标签相似度算法，最多展示4篇相关文章。</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="490" topLeftY="95" width="420" height="120" presetHandlers="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(240,253,244,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(134,239,172,1)" width="1"/></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="108" width="380" height="25"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="15" color="rgba(22,101,52,1)" bold="true"><p>技术实现</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="140" width="380" height="65"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(51,65,85,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6"><p>使用 Ghost 原生 {{#get}} 助手查询，按 primary_tag 过滤同标签文章，排除当前文章，按发布时间降序排列。无需后端代码修改，纯主题层实现。</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="50" topLeftY="235" width="860" height="28"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="16" color="rgba(30,58,138,1)" bold="true"><p>核心代码逻辑</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="50" topLeftY="270" width="860" height="155" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(15,23,42,1)"/></fill></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="70" topLeftY="282" width="820" height="135"><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgba(148,163,184,1)" fontFamily="Consolas" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p><span color="rgba(245,158,11,1)">{{!-- 相关文章推荐：基于主标签相似度 --}}</span></p><p><span color="rgba(59,130,246,1)">{{#get</span> <span color="rgba(16,185,129,1)">"posts"</span> <span color="rgba(248,113,113,1)">filter</span>=<span color="rgba(245,158,11,1)">"primary_tag:{{primary_tag.slug}}+id:-{{id}}"</span></p><p>     <span color="rgba(248,113,113,1)">limit</span>=<span color="rgba(245,158,11,1)">"4"</span> <span color="rgba(248,113,113,1)">order</span>=<span color="rgba(245,158,11,1)">"published_at desc"</span> <span color="rgba(248,113,113,1)">include</span>=<span color="rgba(245,158,11,1)">"tags"</span><span color="rgba(59,130,246,1)">}}</span></p><p>  <span color="rgba(59,130,246,1)">{{#if</span> posts<span color="rgba(59,130,246,1)">}}</span></p><p>    <span color="rgba(59,130,246,1)">{{#foreach</span> posts<span color="rgba(59,130,246,1)">}}</span> <span color="rgba(148,163,184,1)">{{!-- 渲染文章卡片 --}}</span> <span color="rgba(59,130,246,1)">{{/foreach}}</span></p><p>  <span color="rgba(59,130,246,1)">{{else}}</span></p><p>    <span color="rgba(148,163,184,1)">{{!-- 回退：展示最新文章并提示 --}}</span></p><p>  <span color="rgba(59,130,246,1)">{{/if}}</span></p><p><span color="rgba(59,130,246,1)">{{/get}}</span></p></content></shape>
    <shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="50" topLeftY="425" width="420" height="70" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(254,249,195,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(250,204,21,1)" width="1"/></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="65" topLeftY="435" width="390" height="50"><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgba(113,63,18,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5"><p><strong>设计亮点：</strong>优雅降级机制——无同标签文章时自动回退到最新文章，并显示"暂无同标签文章"提示，避免空白区域。</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="490" topLeftY="425" width="420" height="70" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(252,231,243,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(244,114,182,1)" width="1"/></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="505" topLeftY="435" width="390" height="50"><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgba(131,24,67,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5"><p><strong>测试验证：</strong>TC-019 测试用例验证——有标签文章显示相关推荐，无标签文章显示回退内容，推荐数量不超过4篇。</p></content></shape>
  </data>
  <note><content textType="body"><p>第一项自主扩展功能是相关文章推荐。在文章详情页底部，基于当前文章的主标签，查询同标签的其他文章进行推荐，最多展示4篇。技术实现上使用 Ghost 原生的 {{#get}} 助手，纯主题层实现，无需修改后端代码。设计亮点是优雅降级机制：当没有同标签文章时，自动回退到最新文章并给出提示。这项功能通过了 TC-019 测试用例的验证。</p></content></note>
</slide>
